{"audio": "2corinthians-13.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 101867, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 2400, "text": "2 Corinthians, Chapter Thirteen."}, {"start_ms": 2400, "end_ms": 4800, "text": "This is the third time I am coming to you."}, {"start_ms": 4800, "end_ms": 9333, "text": "In the mouth of two or three witnesses shall every word be established."}, {"start_ms": 9333, "end_ms": 26000, "text": "I told you before, and foretell you, as if I were present, the second time; and being absent now I write to them which heretofore have sinned, and to all other, that, if I come again, I will not spare: Since ye seek a proof of Christ speaking in me, which to you-ward is not weak,"}, {"start_ms": 26000, "end_ms": 27600, "text": "but is mighty in you."}, {"start_ms": 27600, "end_ms": 32667, "text": "For though he was crucified through weakness, yet he liveth by the power of God."}, {"start_ms": 32667, "end_ms": 38267, "text": "For we also are weak in him, but we shall live with him by the power of God toward you."}, {"start_ms": 38267, "end_ms": 42533, "text": "Examine yourselves, whether ye be in the faith; prove your own selves."}, {"start_ms": 42533, "end_ms": 48267, "text": "Know ye not your own selves, how that Jesus Christ is in you, except ye be reprobates?"}, {"start_ms": 48267, "end_ms": 51733, "text": "But I trust that ye shall know that we are not reprobates."}, {"start_ms": 51733, "end_ms": 61067, "text": "Now I pray to God that ye do no evil; not that we should appear approved, but that ye should do that which is honest, though we be as reprobates."}, {"start_ms": 61067, "end_ms": 64533, "text": "For we can do nothing against the truth, but for the truth."}, {"start_ms": 64533, "end_ms": 70533, "text": "For we are glad, when we are weak, and ye are strong: and this also we wish, even your perfection."}, {"start_ms": 70533, "end_ms": 81067, "text": "Therefore I write these things being absent, lest being present I should use sharpness, according to the power which the Lord hath given me to edification, and not to destruction."}, {"start_ms": 81067, "end_ms": 83067, "text": "Finally, brethren, farewell."}, {"start_ms": 83067, "end_ms": 90267, "text": "Be perfect, be of good comfort, be of one mind, live in peace; and the God of love and peace shall be with you."}, {"start_ms": 90267, "end_ms": 92267, "text": "Greet one another with an holy kiss."}, {"start_ms": 92267, "end_ms": 93867, "text": "All the saints salute you."}, {"start_ms": 93867, "end_ms": 100800, "text": "The grace of the Lord Jesus Christ, and the love of God, and the communion of the Holy Ghost, be with you all."}, {"start_ms": 100800, "end_ms": 101867, "text": "Amen."}], "words": [{"t": "2", "s": 0, "e": 585, "si": 0}, {"t": "Corinthians,", "s": 585, "e": 1150, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 1392, "e": 1775, "si": 0}, {"t": "Thirteen.", "s": 1835, "e": 2279, "si": 0}, {"t": "This", "s": 2864, "e": 3005, "si": 1}, {"t": "is", "s": 3045, "e": 3126, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 3166, "e": 3247, "si": 1}, {"t": "third", "s": 3328, "e": 3550, "si": 1}, {"t": "time", "s": 3610, "e": 3852, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 3933, "e": 3953, "si": 1}, {"t": "am", "s": 3993, "e": 4054, "si": 1}, {"t": "coming", "s": 4114, "e": 4397, "si": 1}, {"t": "to", "s": 4437, "e": 4497, "si": 1}, {"t": "you.", "s": 4578, "e": 4699, "si": 1}, {"t": "In", "s": 5743, "e": 5803, "si": 2}, {"t": "the", "s": 5823, "e": 5923, "si": 2}, {"t": "mouth", "s": 5943, "e": 6224, "si": 2}, {"t": "of", "s": 6264, "e": 6344, "si": 2}, {"t": "two", "s": 6425, "e": 6605, "si": 2}, {"t": "or", "s": 6665, "e": 6746, "si": 2}, {"t": "three", "s": 6786, "e": 7006, "si": 2}, {"t": "witnesses", "s": 7066, "e": 7528, "si": 2}, {"t": "shall", "s": 7588, "e": 7789, "si": 2}, {"t": "every", "s": 7889, "e": 8109, "si": 2}, {"t": "word", "s": 8190, "e": 8430, "si": 2}, {"t": "be", "s": 8471, "e": 8551, "si": 2}, {"t": "established.", "s": 8611, "e": 9313, "si": 2}, {"t": "I", "s": 10193, "e": 10213